{"name": "The Last of RAM", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE LAST OF RAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your memory is your weapon.<br/>And you\u2019ll have to kill for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Last Of RAM is a fast-paced FPS where movement is the only way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break into high-security data centers, take down everything in your path, and steal what matters most \u2014 RAM.<br/>No cover. No downtime. Just speed, reaction, and constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you stop, you\u2019re dead.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a4a1b3204bc4e6d3465074dcb1813615.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a4a1b3204bc4e6d3465074dcb1813615.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a4a1b3204bc4e6d3465074dcb1813615.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CORE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built around speed and relentless flow:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 run, jump, and wall-run<br/>\u2014 dash, slide, and use ziplines<br/>\u2014 combine gunplay with melee combat<br/>\u2014 make split-second decisions under pressure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core loop:<br/>movement \u2192 combat \u2192 platforming \u2192 objective \u2192 escape<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/ddd69fe618a328146fb974be0d14db44.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/ddd69fe618a328146fb974be0d14db44.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/ddd69fe618a328146fb974be0d14db44.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how you fight:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Pistol \u2014 precision and control<br/>\u2014 Shotgun \u2014 devastating at close range<br/>\u2014 Automatic rifle \u2014 versatile and fast<br/>\u2014 Knife \u2014 speed and risk<br/>\u2014 Katana \u2014 aggressive close combat<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a2c4fe519fc353f44cbad0df1a51209e.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a2c4fe519fc353f44cbad0df1a51209e.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/a2c4fe519fc353f44cbad0df1a51209e.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each type pushes you harder:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Drones \u2014 airborne pressure, never letting you stop<br/>\u2014 Androids \u2014 balanced combat units<br/>\u2014 Heavy units \u2014 slow, durable, and deadly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mistakes are not forgiven.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/0a66f17e83186d5ad77f64e5305de0f2.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/0a66f17e83186d5ad77f64e5305de0f2.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/0a66f17e83186d5ad77f64e5305de0f2.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your movement and combat:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 time slowdown<br/>\u2014 improved mobility<br/>\u2014 enhanced jumps and dashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These are tools, not a safety net.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/d6ad3201798313c79f658088f325205b.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/d6ad3201798313c79f658088f325205b.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/d6ad3201798313c79f658088f325205b.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 fast-paced FPS focused on movement<br/>\u2014 parkour seamlessly integrated into combat<br/>\u2014 short, intense experience (1\u20132 hours)<br/>\u2014 satirical techno setting<br/>\u2014 skill-based, aggressive gameplay<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/4723e0067788e1f94fbf4f81248bd200.poster.avif?t=1787371464\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/4723e0067788e1f94fbf4f81248bd200.webm?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/extras/4723e0067788e1f94fbf4f81248bd200.mp4?t=1787371464\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT THIS GAME IS ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardware prices skyrocketed.<br/>RAM became more valuable than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You go where it still exists.<br/>And you take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No matter the cost.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A fast-paced parkour FPS where movement is survival. Break into secure facilities, fight through enemies, and keep moving or die trying.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4577980/7ceeaf5ac6f93816ba4d3ff44359236426db47d4/header.jpg?t=1787371464", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["FPS", "Parkour", "Shooter", "Female Protagonist", "3D", "Controller"], "developers": "Warkuda", "publishers": "Warkuda", "release_date": "Sep 10, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4577980", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 June 2026 - Request Access\n\n22 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xWQRgzo_kGQ", "first_seen": 1780869600.0, "review_rank": 458}